# Data and databases — never in git.
# Verified by test_no_database_or_data_file_is_tracked_by_git in
# tests/test_foundations.py, which greps `git ls-files` rather than trusting this
# file: MICCV2 had db/app_state.sqlite tracked despite an equivalent rule here,
# because .gitignore does not untrack what is already in.
/data/
/db/
*.duckdb
*.duckdb.wal
*.sqlite
*.sqlite-wal
*.sqlite-shm

# Environment and secrets
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
/secrets/
*.token.json

# Python
.venv/
__pycache__/
*.pyc
.pytest_cache/
.ruff_cache/
.coverage
htmlcov/

# Logs and generated reports
/logs/
/docs/reports/generated/

# OS
.DS_Store

# report build artefacts — node_modules is 54 MB, regenerable
docs/report/build/node_modules/
docs/report/build/*.html
# Scratch from one-off render experiments (raster-vs-vector diagram comparison,
# Google Docs export spike). Underscore-prefixed by convention = disposable.
docs/report/build/_*
